    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. you mentioned the 'idealistic framework' collapsing—do you think the whole concept of relying on these international bodies is actually outdated in today's world? like, is it even realistic to expect them to function as anything more than a talking shop while big powers just do whatever they want?",
