    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, you're kind of dodging the main point there. if the \"core rules\" are being outpaced by conflict, isn't that basically just a polite way of saying they're ineffective? if great powers are just ignoring the rules whenever it suits them, doesn't that make the official internationalist stance more of a delusion than a real strategy?",
